### Option E: Enhanced Custom Admin (No CMS Framework)

Upgrade the existing admin panel to a proper GUI — keep the JSON/GCS architecture but build form-based editors instead of raw JSON.

**Pros:**
- 🟢 **Minimal migration** — same data layer, same deployment
- 🟢 **No new infrastructure** — no database, no extra services
- 🟢 **Full control** — build exactly what you need
- 🟢 **Fastest to implement** — incremental, per-block improvements
- 🟢 **Keep AI editor feature** — unique differentiator

**Cons:**
- 🟡 **More custom code to maintain** — form components for each content type
- 🟡 **No built-in media library** — would need to build one
- 🟡 **Still JSON/GCS at heart** — same limitations persist

