| **1. Foundation** | Create branch, add feature flag, scaffold `AdminV2Page` | None — flag defaults to V1 | Remove flag |
| **2. GUI Editors** | Build form-based editors per block, one at a time | Low — V1 always available | Switch flag to V1 |
